# Petty Cash Period
# Example Business Knowledge expressed in Menata Language
# Domain: Petty Cash — the reconciliation cycle: cash counted + vouchers must equal the float,
# closed independently by someone other than the Custodian, then frozen
# Case 6 of the Case Portfolio (runtime/case-portfolio.md)
# References: pettycash-fund.menata, pettycash-voucher.menata

Cash Period

Fields

- Fund : Petty Cash Fund
- Period Name : Text
- Start Date : Date
- End Date : Date
- Cash Counted : Money
- Reconciled By : User
- Status : Open | Closed

Events

When Close

    Cash Counted plus sum of Vouchers Amount in this Period must equal Fund Fixed Imprest Amount

    Reconciled By must not equal Fund Custodian

    Status Closed

Constraints

- Fund is required.
- Period Name is required.
- Start Date is required.
- End Date is required.

    Cash Counted plus sum of Vouchers Amount in this Period must equal Fund Fixed Imprest Amount.

    Reconciled By must not equal Fund Custodian.

Permissions

Auditor

- Close

Views

- Period Form : Form
- Period List : List
- Period Detail : Detail
